[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l030","ordinal":292609,"en":"Of that howling infidel!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l031","ordinal":292610,"en":"Break the withered spirit"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l032","ordinal":292611,"en":"Of that strutting infidel!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l033","ordinal":292612,"en":"Stretch her out and thrash her like a hide!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l034","ordinal":292613,"en":"Let her gather firewood and carry water;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l035","ordinal":292614,"en":"Give that worn-out harlot"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l036","ordinal":292615,"en":"To the herdsman!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l037","ordinal":292616,"en":"The many wrestlers standing there"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l038","ordinal":292617,"en":"Cried, “Yes, sister-in-law, yes!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1388:b004:l039","ordinal":292618,"en":"And brought great misery upon the woman."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l001","ordinal":292619,"en":"The wrestlers who received the command—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l002","ordinal":292620,"en":"May God have cursed them long before—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l003","ordinal":292621,"en":"Did to poor Akbala"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l004","ordinal":292622,"en":"Exactly as Chachykey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l005","ordinal":292623,"en":"Had ordered:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l006","ordinal":292624,"en":"They slit her crown and put worms in it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l007","ordinal":292625,"en":"Slit her soles and rubbed in salt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l008","ordinal":292626,"en":"Mounted her on a lanky mare,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l009","ordinal":292627,"en":"And clothed her in a coarse felt coat."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l010","ordinal":292628,"en":"The shepherd violated her by force,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l011","ordinal":292629,"en":"The herdsman beat and violated her;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l012","ordinal":292630,"en":"Not once, but a thousand times,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l013","ordinal":292631,"en":"They committed horrors dreadful to know."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l014","ordinal":292632,"en":"Upon Akbala’s head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l015","ordinal":292633,"en":"They heaped not one torment but a thousand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l016","ordinal":292634,"en":"And brought her terrible misery;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l017","ordinal":292635,"en":"Her noble head was enslaved."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l018","ordinal":292636,"en":"Though a virtuous woman, she was beaten"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l019","ordinal":292637,"en":"And reviled by a scabby woman."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l020","ordinal":292638,"en":"To think of it, those were dreadful days:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l021","ordinal":292639,"en":"Kanykey and Akbala"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l022","ordinal":292640,"en":"Became slaves to Khan Kanchoro."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l023","ordinal":292641,"en":"Day followed day,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l024","ordinal":292642,"en":"Each passing in torment;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l025","ordinal":292643,"en":"They sent Akbala barefoot"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l026","ordinal":292644,"en":"To follow behind the cows."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l027","ordinal":292645,"en":"And poor Kanykey"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l028","ordinal":292646,"en":"They made tend the calves."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l029","ordinal":292647,"en":"Let us leave this matter here"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l030","ordinal":292648,"en":"And begin again from another side:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l031","ordinal":292649,"en":"Chürök, the moonlike woman—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l032","ordinal":292650,"en":"Upon Chürök they heaped turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l033","ordinal":292651,"en":"In the havoc inflicted upon Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l034","ordinal":292652,"en":"Who showed regard for ancestral spirits?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l035","ordinal":292653,"en":"Every one of the bloodthirsty hero’s countless treasures"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l036","ordinal":292654,"en":"They went and plundered, leaving nothing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l037","ordinal":292655,"en":"They seized all her silks,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l038","ordinal":292656,"en":"And brought grievous misery;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b003:l039","ordinal":292657,"en":"They plundered all the gold"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l001","ordinal":292658,"en":"And inflicted bitter suffering."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l002","ordinal":292659,"en":"Chürök became war-spoil—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l003","ordinal":292660,"en":"Such was the havoc"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l004","ordinal":292661,"en":"The Jediger brought upon her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l005","ordinal":292662,"en":"In the mountains were ninety thousand horses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l006","ordinal":292663,"en":"But no swift courser or peerless steed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l007","ordinal":292664,"en":"After the mountain-like bloodthirsty hero,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l008","ordinal":292665,"en":"No son remained!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l009","ordinal":292666,"en":"On the hills grazed piebald horses,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l010","ordinal":292667,"en":"With coursers and thoroughbreds among them;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l011","ordinal":292668,"en":"There were fleet stallions, but no mares,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l012","ordinal":292669,"en":"And to guard those horses"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l013","ordinal":292670,"en":"No heir of the bloodthirsty hero remained—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l014","ordinal":292671,"en":"Such filth is this world!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l015","ordinal":292672,"en":"Countless treasures and myriad possessions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l016","ordinal":292673,"en":"Were seized by fools, who rose to power;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l017","ordinal":292674,"en":"Alas, the precious world had gone awry,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l018","ordinal":292675,"en":"And his poor mother was humiliated."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l019","ordinal":292676,"en":"All the noblewomen were beaten,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l020","ordinal":292677,"en":"All the young wives were plundered,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l021","ordinal":292678,"en":"While Kanchoro ruled the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l022","ordinal":292679,"en":"Established in the palace."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l023","ordinal":292680,"en":"Chürök, the moonlike woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l024","ordinal":292681,"en":"The Jediger warrior Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l025","ordinal":292682,"en":"Had taken as war-spoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l026","ordinal":292683,"en":"The myriad herds left by the bloodthirsty hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l027","ordinal":292684,"en":"He drove away in their entirety,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l028","ordinal":292685,"en":"And every treasure of the lionhearted warrior"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l029","ordinal":292686,"en":"He plundered and carried off."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l030","ordinal":292687,"en":"The Jediger raided,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l031","ordinal":292688,"en":"Felling the plane trees,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l032","ordinal":292689,"en":"Breaking down and toppling the palace;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l033","ordinal":292690,"en":"Sixty women and widowed sisters-in-law"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l034","ordinal":292691,"en":"They noisily carried off as spoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l035","ordinal":292692,"en":"They unleashed terrible misery,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l036","ordinal":292693,"en":"And many households of orphans and widows"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l037","ordinal":292694,"en":"Beneath the wrath of warrior Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l038","ordinal":292695,"en":"Were slaughtered and left dead."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1389:b004:l039","ordinal":292696,"en":"They cut down and felled the poplars,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l001","ordinal":292697,"en":"Broke down and toppled the palace,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l002","ordinal":292698,"en":"And utterly slaughtered"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l003","ordinal":292699,"en":"Every last guard."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l004","ordinal":292700,"en":"If Chürök talked back,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l005","ordinal":292701,"en":"They had devised a way to deal with her;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l006","ordinal":292702,"en":"If she unexpectedly resisted,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l007","ordinal":292703,"en":"If she chanced to answer back,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l008","ordinal":292704,"en":"They would seize her and cut off her head,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l009","ordinal":292705,"en":"Drag her along the road,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l010","ordinal":292706,"en":"And hand her over to the Danggyt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l011","ordinal":292707,"en":"Gouge out both her eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l012","ordinal":292708,"en":"And if the wretch grew defiant,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l013","ordinal":292709,"en":"Destroy and slaughter her—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l014","ordinal":292710,"en":"Such was the Jediger’s intent."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l015","ordinal":292711,"en":"Upon Chürök, the sunlike woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l016","ordinal":292712,"en":"They brought anguish and calamity;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l017","ordinal":292713,"en":"Upon Chürök, the moonlike woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l018","ordinal":292714,"en":"They inflicted brutal oppression,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l019","ordinal":292715,"en":"And plunged her into numbing misery."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l020","ordinal":292716,"en":"On this side of Chürök"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l021","ordinal":292717,"en":"Stood black-hearted men,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l022","ordinal":292718,"en":"Wrestlers crowding all around her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l023","ordinal":292719,"en":"When told to take a cap, they cut off a head—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l024","ordinal":292720,"en":"Violent men surpassing ordinary mortals."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l025","ordinal":292721,"en":"Looking to the other side,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l026","ordinal":292722,"en":"There stood men in yellow rawhide trousers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l027","ordinal":292723,"en":"Each one able to face countless foes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l028","ordinal":292724,"en":"Their quivers bound and arrows counted,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l029","ordinal":292725,"en":"Wrath blazing upon their faces"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l030","ordinal":292726,"en":"As though they would slaughter once again."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l031","ordinal":292727,"en":"Looking upon this side,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l032","ordinal":292728,"en":"They held spears without tassels,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l033","ordinal":292729,"en":"Gripping the shafts greedily,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l034","ordinal":292730,"en":"And thrusting them high aloft;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l035","ordinal":292731,"en":"When battle was joined,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l036","ordinal":292732,"en":"They never fearfully exposed their flanks."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l037","ordinal":292733,"en":"When they moved, no living soul endured;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l038","ordinal":292734,"en":"Whoever appeared before them"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b003:l039","ordinal":292735,"en":"They crushed into earth as soft as felt."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l001","ordinal":292736,"en":"Brandishing their spears,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l002","ordinal":292737,"en":"Another band entered."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l003","ordinal":292738,"en":"When she saw those wrestlers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l004","ordinal":292739,"en":"Your sister-in-law nearly died on the spot."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l005","ordinal":292740,"en":"The valiant woman withered to a shadow,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l006","ordinal":292741,"en":"As the many wrestlers bore down;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l007","ordinal":292742,"en":"The crowd of wrestlers pressed mercilessly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l008","ordinal":292743,"en":"And when your sunlike, fierce sister-in-law"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l009","ordinal":292744,"en":"Suffered this guilty torment,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l010","ordinal":292745,"en":"Her ribs felt torn apart,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l011","ordinal":292746,"en":"Tears poured from her eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l012","ordinal":292747,"en":"And her heart was bitterly divided."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l013","ordinal":292748,"en":"From shame she longed to die,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l014","ordinal":292749,"en":"But the wretched woman could not,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l015","ordinal":292750,"en":"For there was a child in her womb."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l016","ordinal":292751,"en":"From shame she longed to depart,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l017","ordinal":292752,"en":"But the wretched woman could not,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l018","ordinal":292753,"en":"For she carried an unborn child."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l019","ordinal":292754,"en":"She screamed and wept aloud;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l020","ordinal":292755,"en":"Parted from her lionhearted hero,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l021","ordinal":292756,"en":"She longed for death but could not die,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l022","ordinal":292757,"en":"Unable to take her own life,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l023","ordinal":292758,"en":"Unable to stem the tears from her eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l024","ordinal":292759,"en":"While her nose ran like a spring"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l025","ordinal":292760,"en":"And your sister-in-law could not wipe it away."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l026","ordinal":292761,"en":"She wailed, “My bloodthirsty hero!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l027","ordinal":292762,"en":"“There is no cherished son to console me!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l028","ordinal":292763,"en":"Oh, my mother!” she sobbed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l029","ordinal":292764,"en":"“The Creator has destined me for disaster,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l030","ordinal":292765,"en":"And there is no choice but to bear it!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l031","ordinal":292766,"en":"Among the many people, none can be my support;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l032","ordinal":292767,"en":"The gray-maned hero left no son."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l033","ordinal":292768,"en":"When grievous trouble befalls this forlorn head,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l034","ordinal":292769,"en":"There is no choice but to endure it!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l035","ordinal":292770,"en":"The birth mother of that gray-maned hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l036","ordinal":292771,"en":"Is, to me, the ill-fated Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390:b004:l037","ordinal":292772,"en":"The blessed brow of the noble one;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1390